== Required materials == 

  * 1 x LM7805 (Voltage regulator, consider a step-down model)
  * 1 x Ceramic capacitor 0,33uF 20V
  * 1 x Ceramic capacitor 0,1uF 5V
  * 1 x Electrolytic capacitor 100uF 25V
  * 3 x Resistors 15K 0,25W
  * 1 x USB Connector

